# GS-008: An inert gas at fixed volume changes total pressure, not the carbon dose
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
seal v1 500mL
add v1 CO2 0.001mol
inspect v1
measure v1 pressure
add v1 N2 0.005mol
inspect v1
measure v1 pressure
inspect
